<title>JAPAN: Sega shares drop on news of merger with Bandai.</title>
<headline>Sega shares drop on news of merger with Bandai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in gamemaker Sega Enterprises Ltd dropped on Friday morning, following its announcement on Thursday of its planned merger with toy manufacturer Bandai Co Ltd on October 1.</p>
<p>The share price was down 260 yen at 3,400 yen as of 0021 GMT, on volume of 140,400 shares.</p>
</text>
